      "id": "NUM-001",
      "category": "unit_mismatch_articles_vs_openings",
      "finding_summary": "The 'about 6 percent' yield divides 2 distinct openings by 34 unique articles, so the numerator and denominator count different units. The paper's own coding puts 5 articles (15%) as relevant, or 3 (about 9%) after pre-opening articles are excluded.",
